{"version":1,"content":"<p>2022年香港小姐競選友誼小姐邢慧敏（Sharon)，出名朋友多，日前32歲生日便獲昔日舊戰友一同慶生，Sharon分享當日生日照，她和前新聞小花何思懿在內，5美齊穿上黑色裝束，充滿儀式感。</p><p>由選美入行至今，不經不覺5年，這份友誼更加彌足珍貴</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:55.960741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:16.238995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:16.238995+00:00","content_hash":"b3cd4aa9d0a4185811c4c1e9a3a877b0d01fe3a79b423626c6c70ec25467abd9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}